#Lua SEXPs

$Operator: run-glowmap-flicker
$Category: Change
$Subcategory: LUA-Action
$Minimum Arguments: 2
$Maximum Arguments: 3
$Return Type: Nothing
$Description: Flickers the glowmap/thrusters of a large ship for a given duration. Does not work in multiplayer. 
$Parameter: 
	+Description: Ship to flicker the glowmap/thrusters.
	+Type: Ship
$Parameter: 
	+Description: Duration of the flickering in seconds. Default is 5 seconds.
	+Type: Number
$Parameter: 
	+Description: Final status of the glowmap/thrusters. True enables them when the effect is over. False disables them when the effect is over. Default is False.
	+Type: Boolean

#End